          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala EJAKAIT ebe, “Amwatari eoŋ ituŋanan yenabu kasub kakwap; ageun kotunanan, ka etiaŋ, ka lueliatos, ka lueporitos kapak; naarai eitu eoŋ kanuabu kasubunia kes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
